                  </msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i3">
                     <locus from="30r" to="32r" facs="034"/>
                    <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT5888AsmatPrayer">ʾAsmāt-prayer of the Seven Archangels, Dǝrsanä Zäsäbatu Liqǝnä Mäla’kǝt, <foreign xml:lang="gez">ድርሳን፡ ዘሰባቱ፡ ሊቃነ፡ መላእክት፡</foreign>
